---
title: "getLegionAddress (LegionAddressRegistry)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_lookup: getLegionAddress(identifier)
    q_lookup --> q_check: addr = registry[identifier]
    q_check --> q_return: addr != address(0)
    q_check --> q_revert: addr == address(0)
    q_return --> [*]: return addr
    q_revert --> [*]: revert AddressNotFound

    note right of q_lookup
        INV-001: view function, no state changes
        INV-002: all sale contracts query this during syncLegionAddresses
    end note
